1
00:00:00,175 --> 00:00:01,845
(Sheldon:)What about our trips
to Disneyland?

2
00:00:01,843 --> 00:00:04,983
(Sheldon:)How can we do those things
with a child around?

3
00:00:06,148 --> 00:00:08,978
(Leonard:)Relax, there's room
for two babies in this group.

4
00:00:08,984 --> 00:00:10,354
(Sheldon:)Oh, dear L...

5
00:00:10,352 --> 00:00:12,252
(Sheldon:)Penny's pregnant, too?

6
00:00:12,254 --> 00:00:14,424
(Leonard:)You're the other baby.

7
00:00:14,423 --> 00:00:15,853
(Sheldon:)Oh, really?

8
00:00:15,857 --> 00:00:19,127
(Sheldon:)Okay, well, would a baby have
to shave once every 11 days?

9
00:00:21,163 --> 00:00:23,733
(Leonard:)Would an adult refuse
to eat his graham crackers

10
00:00:23,732 --> 00:00:25,832
(Leonard:)because one of them was broken?

11
00:00:25,834 --> 00:00:27,704
(Sheldon:)I guess we'll call this a draw.

12
00:00:30,472 --> 00:00:32,242
(Bernadette:)So, I'm glad
you guys are here.

13
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:33,840
(Bernadette:)There's something I want
to share with you.

14
00:00:33,842 --> 00:00:36,272
(Bernadette:)Howie and I are going to...

15
00:00:36,278 --> 00:00:37,908
(Penny(reading text):)Leonard says you're pregnant.

16
00:00:37,913 --> 00:00:39,183
(Leonard:)What?

17
00:00:39,181 --> 00:00:40,081
"Don't say anything.

18
00:00:40,082 --> 00:00:41,982
(Penny:)Act surprised
when she tells you."

19
00:00:41,983 --> 00:00:43,883
(Penny:)All right,
how you want to do this?

20
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:46,890
(Bernadette:)I'm pregnant.

21
00:00:46,888 --> 00:00:48,288
(Penny:)Oh, my God, I
can't believe it!

22
00:00:48,290 --> 00:00:49,560
This is so exciting!

23
00:00:49,558 --> 00:00:52,228
(Bernadette:)Yeah, it's all real exciting.

24
00:00:52,227 --> 00:00:55,297
Are-are you not
happy about this?

25
00:00:55,297 --> 00:00:58,527
(Bernadette:)I am. Of-of course I am. I'm...

26
00:00:58,533 --> 00:01:01,023
(Bernadette:)I'm sure it's just the hormones.

